# Admin Dashboard — TokenRealty Frontend

Human docs: [docs/rules/admin-dashboard.md](../../docs/rules/admin-dashboard.md).

## Stack

React 19 + TypeScript, Vite (`:5174`), TanStack Query, React Router, Tailwind.

## Rules

- All API calls through gateway — `VITE_API_BASE_URL` or Vite proxy `/api` → `:8080`
- JWT in `AuthProvider` / sessionStorage key `tokenrealty.admin.auth` (separate from investor portal)
- Admin roles: `ADMIN`, `COMPLIANCE`, `PROPERTY_MANAGER` — enforce in `AdminRoute`
- KYC verify: `PATCH /v1/compliance/{id}/verify` with `{ kycExpiresAt }` — backend requires ADMIN/COMPLIANCE
- Buildings: `GET /v1/buildings` — any authenticated role
- Types in `src/types/api.ts` — keep aligned with Java DTOs
- No wagmi — admin app has no wallet connection

## Do not

- Call microservice ports directly from browser code
- Reuse investor portal sessionStorage key
- Add Redux — TanStack Query + Auth context is enough

## Run

```bash
cd frontend/admin-dashboard && npm install && npm run dev
```

Gateway `:8080` must be up. Demo login: `admin@tokenrealty.com` / `admin123`.
